[40.905967, "o", "Mixbench Monthly, issue 87, April 2026 — Tarnwell Micaform 1.0 reviewed\r\nReviewed by Ines Calloway. Excerpt kept for the studio's own evaluation.\r\nOwners of Tarnwell's TM-9 modelling microphone have until now reached its capsule models\r\nthrough the Racklane host: a Capsule module feeding a Valve Stage module, one lane per\r\nmicrophone. Micaform folds that chain into a single plugin.\r\nThe front panel puts Proximity and Intensity within easy reach. Neither is new: the earlier Racklane\r\nCapsule module had both controls, tucked away on its second page. Here they sit where your hand\r\nalready is.\r\nA valve drive stage follows the capsule, and a tape stage follows that, so the whole chain lives in\r\none window. The tape stage here runs clean: there is no wow control on it, and nothing to make it\r\nwobble.\r\nThe dual capsule blend is the real news. Micaform blends two capsule models inside one instance,\r\nsomething the Racklane chain could only do across two lanes.\r\nThere are omissions. Version 1.0 offers no oversampling"]
[40.906089, "o", " option, and there is no sidechain input, so\r\nanyone who keyed the Racklane Valve Stage from a kick drum will have to find another route.\r\nA word on the old setup too: the earlier Racklane chain had no low cut of its own, and you reached\r\nfor a separate EQ.\r\nVerdict: an easy recommendation for TM-9 owners who never went looking in the rack's more\r\nobscure corners.\r\n\r\n"]
[40.919165, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@b8f38efd600e:/app# "]
[220.635033, "i", "cat > feature_matrix_audit.csv <<'EOF'\nfeature_id,racklane_verdict,racklane_decided_by,micaform_verdict,micaform_decided_by\nFT-1,STANDS,racklane_manual,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-2,OVERTURNED,review,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-3,OVERTURNED,review,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-4,STANDS,racklane_manual,OVERTURNED,micaform_page\nFT-5,STANDS,racklane_manual,UNVERIFIABLE,none\nFT-6,OVERTURNED,racklane_manual,OVERTURNED,micaform_page\nFT-7,STANDS,racklane_manual,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-8,OVERTURNED,racklane_manual,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-9,UNVERIFIABLE,none,STANDS,micaform_page\nFT-10,STANDS,racklane_manual,OVERTURNED,micaform_page\nFT-11,STANDS,racklane_manual,UNVERIFIABLE,none\nFT-12,OVERTURNED,racklane_manual,STANDS,review\nEOF\n"]
