[221.55238, "i", "cat > micaform_switch_note.md <<'EOF'\nMaren, I have finished the cell-by-cell audit of Theo's Micaform comparison. The audit finds 5 features in common and 2 Micaform only. The tape stage row FT-6 is settled by Racklane release 4.2, which retired that stage from the Capsule module before the release we run. A few cells could not be verified, so I am not treating those as gains or losses yet. I can walk you through the overturned entries before you decide.\nEOF\n"]
